Initial commit: full-site Astro rebuild of Renewing Hope Strategies

- Astro 5 + Tailwind CSS 3 + Decap CMS + Netlify
- Brand palette sampled from official logo (plum + sage + gold)
- 35 static pages: home, services, city-service SEO, locations, about, board, sliding-scale, events, donate, contact, get-involved, privacy, 404
- Persistent 988 crisis bar sitewide
- Scroll-reveal, count-up, gradient-mesh, float, wing motifs
- Astro View Transitions for SPA-like navigation
- All old Wix URLs redirected (301) preserving local SEO
- Givebutter donations, Formspree contact/newsletter forms